Candidate ID: `{{ENTRY_ID}}`.

The submitted contribution is an AI-assisted Lean 4 formalization of the complete qualitative theorem: for every positive real c there is a positive proportion and a threshold, both depending only on c, that work for every sufficiently large uniform hypergraph with at most c · 2ⁿ edges. Koishi Chan's existing mathematical solution remains credited. This PR does not claim a new resolution, established priority, an announced award, or entitlement to payment.

